===Scrapped Toons & Twisteds===
There are currently 3 known scrapped [[Toons]] and [[Twisteds]] created for [[Dandy's World]] which will never be added to the game. If these Toons and Twisteds had been finalized, they would've filled the counters to {{#expr: {{ToonAmount}}+3}} playable Toons and {{#expr: {{TwistedAmount}}+3}} Twisteds.

====2024 Halloween Toons & Twisteds====
The 3 [[Toons]] and [[Twisteds]] about to be mentioned were meant for the 2024 [[Halloween Event]], which was cancelled due to the only developer being fired. The names of the Toons are the only thing revealed, but their structure could signify their role and object they're meant to be, much like other Toons (ie: {{CI|Poppy|name=true}}'s name is related to popping, and she's a bubble, which pop on contact). The Toons are not coming to future Halloween Events due to [[Qwel]] thinking their designs weren't interesting enough to be added. Due to them never being added to the game, their concept art will not be released, as Qwel didn't want to disappoint any players who might believe them to be [[upcoming]] Toons. If they did release, they would have been the first set of [[Holiday Toons]] and [[Holiday Twisteds]].

=====Countess & Twisted Countess=====
Countess and Twisted Countess are one of the 3 scrapped [[Toons]] and [[Twisteds]] meant for the 2024 [[Halloween Event]]. Not much is known about Countess other than her name. From the sound of her name, it can be assumed she was intended to be a female Toon themed around vampires, due to the word "countess" often being used to refer to female vampires. She could've also been something like a grandfather clock, due to the word "count" in her name, which could relate to counting seconds, minutes or hours on a clock.

=====Duke & Twisted Duke=====
Duke and Twisted Duke are one of the 3 scrapped [[Toons]] and [[Twisteds]] meant for the 2024 [[Halloween Event]]. Not much is known about Duke other than his name. From the sound of his name, it can be assumed he was intended to be a male Toon. Unlike Harvey and Countess, his name doesn't have any obvious clues that hint to what he could've been, due to no real words being close to it, the closest being a male holding the highest hereditary title in the British and certain other peerages, however it wouldn't make sense for a Halloween event.

=====Harvey & Twisted Harvey=====
Harvey and Twisted Harvey are one of the 3 scrapped [[Toons]] and [[Twisteds]] meant for the 2024 [[Halloween Event]]. Not much is known about Harvey other than their name, though, from the sound of their name, it can be assumed they were intended to be a pumpkin or a scarecrow since their name refers to harvesting. If {{TI|Pumpkins|name=true}} were also the planned [[Currency]] for the 2024 Halloween Event, that might have meant Harvey could have been the {{Type|Main}} [[Holiday Toon]] for the [[Event]], and the idea of a pumpkin [[Main]] Toon could have been repurposed for {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}.

