====Flutter & Twisted Flutter Designs====
{{CI|Flutter|name=true}}'s design was originally going to be depicted more like an actual butterfly. Her antennae were curled as was her proboscis, which were more accurate to her class. Her wings had a clover-like pattern (similar to {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}) instead of a singular heart, she was slightly shorter, her dress had frilly ends and there was more fluff under her thorax. She also was originally going to be depicted walking instead of flying. The clovers on her wings as well as the decision to have her walk instead of fly, were elements that were reused for her brother {{CI|Flyte|name=true}}'s design.

{{CI|Twisted Flutter|name=true}}'s design was originally going to be much duller in color: her wings were blue, her wings and left antenna were more ruptured, her proboscis was more elongated, almost like a noose, and her eyes were designed to be black, dilated pupils with faded red sclera.
