====Twisted Shelly Designs====
{{CI|Twisted Shelly|name=true}} was originally going to be much different from the one we have today. Her body was broken into 3 parts: her head, torso and legs, all connected by {{TI|Ichor|name=true}}, which would have given her a considerably large height. Her eyes would have also been mismatched, her left eye having a large black pupil with a red dot in the center, while the right eye resembled the current design, having a red slit instead. This design was scrapped due to [[Qwel]] wanting her design to reference more to a dinosaur, as it ties back to {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}'s passionate affinity of paleontology.

She also had another drafted design that was drastically different from her final design. This design carries more resemblance to her original Toon self, but with black branches stretching out of her back, eyes, and heels, and having black limbs and feet. This design also gave her larger claws, and hearts on her palms, but she possessed no eyes. This iteration of Twisted Shelly might have been inspiration for {{CI|Goob|name=true}} and {{CI|Twisted Goob|name=true}} due to the Twisted Shelly's arms and hands having the exact same design as Twisted Goob's, just with different colors and black heart palms.

Qwel stated in a Q&A that Twisted Shelly was originally supposed to depict an {{wp|Allosaurus}}, however her size was too small to accommodate as one. Due to this, it's been also stated by Qwel that she's more likely a mixture of many dinosaurs. She also said that Shelly would've had feathers if she were depicting a {{wp|Velociraptor}} or any raptor within the {{wp|Dromaeosauridae}} family.
