=====Dandy's Voting Icon=====
Before Release, {{CI|Dandy|name=true}} might have had a different voting icon, found in the "Welcome to Gardenview" [[Poster]], as all of the [[Toons]] on the poster have their voting icons from that, with the exception of some. It is likely that Dandy's wasn't added to his code when voting, but the artwork is still used in the Dandy cutouts found in some of the maps. This unused icon seems to look like he is running with his hand up while smiling, presumably at the viewer.

The Icon that was used in the game for over a year was likely a placeholder icon which was never replaced. This old Dandy icon came from his most recent concept art, which was him smiling at the viewer and holding his hands together, slightly leaning over with hearts.

In [[Changelog|v0.11.1]], Dandy was finally given a proper voting icon to replace his old placeholder icon. His new icon is like the old one; a waist-up view of himself, with him having a seemingly worried yet smiling expression, holding his hands over his cheeks.
